Modifications made in this fork (Scene-Re), compared to the upstream project:
  - rebranded to "Scene-Re" (app label, icon, strings, package identity);
  - removed dead online services (in-app update checker, "Scene-Online"
    script browser, cloud auto-skip configuration) — the app runs offline;
  - removed unused code paths and adjusted runtime package references;
  - build modernization (Gradle/AGP/Kotlin/Compose versions, CMake, signing).

